[00:16.08]Jehovah our God, exalted in might,
[00:24.16]Creator of life and Provider of light.
[00:32.28]Creation speaks of your power so grand;
[00:40.08]The heavens and earth forever stand.
[00:49.98]Your heavenly throne, on justice it stands.
[00:58.06]To us you make known all your righteous commands.
[01:06.20]And as we turn to your Word, we can see
[01:12.88]Your wisdom revealed so brilliantly.
[01:54.06]The greatest of all is your perfect love.
[02:02.20]Beyond all compare are your gifts from above.
[02:10.18]Your attributes and your glorious name,
[02:17.80]With joy and with zeal, we will proclaim.
